The basic distributed data relay process for a given sensor vi can be briefly described by
\par
Algorithm 1. Each sensor keeps a local data set Li to store the up-to-date data it receives and senses.
\par
For any data dj sensed or received by vi, dj is first put into the local data set Li of vi. Next, vi tries to
\par
