\par
so no explanation to that effect is provided. If the quality of these fused data is beyond the predefined
\par
threshold, vi will stop the propagation of this data and fuse them into a piece of valuable information
\par
Ih with a credible confidence about a target Tk. Otherwise, vi will add the data into the pending queue
\par
pendingQuei, and make communication decisions for all data in this queue.
