\par
of ammonia nitrogen (NH3-N); and 100,000 RMB (15873 US\$) per ton of total phosphorus
\par
(TP). This approach, by determining the standards of water quality at the trans-boundary
\par
sections, effectively alleviates the water pollution at watersheds. Water quality was mon-
\par
