\textbf{3 Development of an efficient discretization procedure}
\par
\textbf{3.1 Optimization of the FORM approximation}
\par
We present the optimal discretization for the FORM approximation {$G$}!({$\mathbf{U}$}) for {$n$} = 2 and
\par
{$n$} = 3 dimensions. Extension to higher numbers of random variables is discussed. Because
\par
the linear LSF employed in FORM is described only by the reliability index {$B$}!"\#\$ and the
\par
vector {$\mathbf{\alpha}$} of FORM sensitives (Eq. 4), it facilitates parametric studies.
\par
Initially, we consider a reliability index {$B$}!"\#\$ = 4.26, corresponding to a probability of
\par
